<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt">The financial statements of
Golden Heaven Group Holdings Ltd. as of September&nbsp;30, 2024, 2023 and 2022 and for the&nbsp;years then ended included in this prospectus
have been so included in reliance on the report of Assentsure PAC, an independent registered public accounting firm, given on the authority
of said firm as an expert in auditing and accounting.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24pt">&nbsp;</P>

